For 2.1.0, how to achieve the behavior of `pct_change(fill_method=None)` from the previous versions?

About this new change, the [What's New page](https://<redacted-host>/pandas-docs/version/2.1.0/whatsnew/v2.1.0.html) says to explicitly call `ffill` or `bfill` before calling `pct_change`. But my question is when I don't want to fill in any value (i.e. `fill_method=None` in previous versions).

@reporter @participant1
